# C++ formatting for boring-core.
#
# Our C++ compiles inside the Chromium tree, so we format exactly like
# Chromium. clang-format ships the "Chromium" style built in, so this file
# is deliberately tiny on purpose: don't add house rules that would drift
# from upstream and make the monthly rebase harder.
#
# Format a file:   clang-format -i path/to/file.cc
# Editors:         turn on "format on save" using clang-format.
BasedOnStyle: Chromium
